Read `DESIGN.md` and `styles/tokens.css` before visual work. Do not restyle from memory.

Locked

- Inter for UI and body. Space Grotesk only for display / brand numerals.
- One accent (`--blue` / `#4890f7`). Status colours are status only.
- Components consume semantic tokens. Hex is born only in `styles/tokens.css`.
- Dark is default. Light must still hit WCAG AA. Check both before shipping colour.
- Motion is scroll-driven, expo-out, via `FadeUp` / `MotionProvider`. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- One idea per screen. At most one `.label` eyebrow per viewport.
- Audience is men and women, 18–80. Do not default copy, imagery captions, or stats to "men" unless the sentence is about a male-specific condition.

Reject

- Biov8 energy, Hormn gloss, Everlab bland, generic shadcn wellness.
- Glass on flat canvas, bento-as-decoration, gradient text, side-stripe cards.
- Outcome photography. Process only (pathology, consult, protocol).
- Pricing on the homepage. Pricing lives on `/pricing` and `/membership`.

If a section needs a second accent to feel designed, the section is wrong.

Homepage stage (2026-09-27, Noah): the BioTrack/Fulcrum bar overrides "glass on flat canvas" for the ice stage only. Glass chips and cards sit on the renders, never on plain white.
Stage colours live in `--stage-*` (tokens.css); renders in `public/3d` (cyan) and `public/3d/red` (`?tone=red`). Buttons stay Apex blue in both tones.
Red never marks a result on the stage; gauges and status chips keep their meaning.
